{"3908280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duality Shift", "steam_appid": 3908280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR WORLD BY RIDING THE LINE BETWEEN PURITY AND CORRUPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DUALITY SHIFT is a frenetic FPS Platformer that mixes speedrunning, reality shifting and ultra-dynamic movement, born from a student project at Accademia Italiana Videogiochi.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWITCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between the pure world and the corrupted version to unlock hidden paths and phantom platforms, use the electric lines to charge yourself up, run on walls or climb on top of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.poster.avif?t=1774620469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.webm?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.mp4?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK EVERY RECORD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a race against time, with medals to unlock and records to break. Are you fast enough to dominate the online leaderboards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/939e45a556c22e930898e9ca51e2bd52.poster.avif?t=1774620469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/939e45a556c22e930898e9ca51e2bd52.webm?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/939e45a556c22e930898e9ca51e2bd52.mp4?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE TRUTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and progress in the story to uncover the reason behind your misterious powers.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR WORLD BY RIDING THE LINE BETWEEN PURITY AND CORRUPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DUALITY SHIFT is a frenetic FPS Platformer that mixes speedrunning, reality shifting and ultra-dynamic movement, born from a student project at Accademia Italiana Videogiochi.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SWITCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between the pure world and the corrupted version to unlock hidden paths and phantom platforms, use the electric lines to charge yourself up, run on walls or climb on top of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.poster.avif?t=1774620469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.webm?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908280/extras/0c2398536f16018bdbc9b672f7fa3ed5.mp4?t=1774620469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK EVERY RECORD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a race against time, with medals to unlock and records to break. Are you fast enough to dominate the online leaderboards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im